{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的高亮词串起了在意、对方没有退开、想靠近又收住、最终不再隐藏喜欢的关系因果；Y 的大块虽然完整，却较多停留在抽象的满足、投入和松弛，具体发生了什么不够清楚。small：X 的感受补出了鼻酸、喉咙发紧、独处时泛酸等具体体验，大多能挂回当屏情境；Y 的感受和旁注虽然丰富，但重复大字意思和相近意象的情况更多。core：X 持续呈现亲密带来的幸福与害怕它留不住的痛楚如何缠在一起；concise：X 虽有回环，但关系每屏都有推进，Y 多次重复留久、保持、永久保证和满足等意思；human：Y 的“清澈的舒服”“想要更多的渴求悬着”“留下低低的回望”等搭配生硬，带有摘要腔，X 整体更符合日常说话习惯；fine：X 的“还没有失去什么，就已经舍不得”“白天和某个人相处得很好，独处时心头却泛酸”等感受更具体、有辨识度，Y 则较常用满足、幸福、愉悦、痛楚等概括；load：X 的高亮短语虽然略多，但长度短、意群清楚，Y 每屏累积多块较长的大字，整体扫读负担更重。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a62fa45e-9829-4c09-ba51-36edc6607dca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T130540452842Z", "elapsed_seconds": 236.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T13:09:36.485535+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "03df142d7a6a168ab3f4f69ecf77baff29c058dcfa9c21260bf24a818e34333e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\